  "$id": "https://metaviewer.local/contracts/v0.2/capsule_resource_inventory.schema.json",
  "title": "Normal ARM64 source-bound allocation journal row",
  "description": "New metadata-only contract. payload is exact JSON text; runtime validates decoded payload against body and cross-row lifecycle. Digest binds ASCII seq, LF, prev, LF, UTF8 payload. No existing wire envelope is changed.",
